{
  "schema": "s10y-choice-seed-v1",
  "source": {
    "book": "10c",
    "lesson": "ana10-c6-ex",
    "concept_figure_ids": []
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "number": "335",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u5bfc\u51fd\u6570\uff1a\n335. $y=\\sin5x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "336",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u5bfc\u51fd\u6570\uff1a\n336. $y=\\cos\\left(6x+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "337",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u5bfc\u51fd\u6570\uff1a\n337. $y=\\cos^2(ax+b)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "338",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u5bfc\u51fd\u6570\uff1a\n338. $y=2x\\sin x-(x^2-2.3)\\cos(x+2)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "339",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u5bfc\u51fd\u6570\uff1a\n339. $y=(x^2+x+1)\\sin3x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "340",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u5bfc\u51fd\u6570\uff1a\n340. $y=\\sin x\\cos x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "341",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u5bfc\u51fd\u6570\uff1a\n341. $y=\\operatorname{tg}x+(1+\\operatorname{ctg}x)\\cos x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "342",
      "text": "\u6c42\u6781\u9650\uff1a\n342*. $\\lim_{x\\to\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)}{\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "343",
      "text": "\u6c42\u6781\u9650\uff1a\n343*. $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin3x}{5x}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "344",
      "text": "\u6c42\u6781\u9650\uff1a\n344*. $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin4x}{\\sin7x}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "345",
      "text": "\u6c42\u6781\u9650\uff1a\n345*. $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin5x}{\\operatorname{tg}3x}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "346",
      "text": "\u786e\u5b9a\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u7684\u632f\u5e45\u3001\u5468\u671f\u548c\u521d\u76f8\uff1a\n346.\na) $y=3\\sin\\left(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$\uff1b\nb) $y=2\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{5}-4x\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "347",
      "text": "\u786e\u5b9a\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u7684\u632f\u5e45\u3001\u5468\u671f\u548c\u521d\u76f8\uff1a\n347*.\na) $y=-0.6\\cos\\left(\\frac{1}{2}x+0.3\\pi\\right)$\uff1b\nb) $y=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\sin(x+1)+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos(x+1)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "348",
      "text": "\u5229\u7528\u5bfc\u6570\u8ba8\u8bba\u51fd\u6570\u5e76\u4f5c\u51fa\u5b83\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff1a\n348*. $f(x)=1.5\\cos\\left(2\\frac{2}{3}x+\\frac{\\pi}{9}\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "349",
      "text": "\u5229\u7528\u5bfc\u6570\u8ba8\u8bba\u51fd\u6570\u5e76\u4f5c\u51fa\u5b83\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff1a\n349*. $g(x)=3\\cos\\left(1\\frac{2}{3}x+\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "350",
      "text": "\u5229\u7528\u5bfc\u6570\u8ba8\u8bba\u51fd\u6570\u5e76\u4f5c\u51fa\u5b83\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff1a\n350. \u8bd5\u786e\u5b9a\u51fd\u6570$y=\\cos\\left(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$\u662f\u4e0d\u662f\u5fae\u5206\u65b9\u7a0b$y''=-4y$\u7684\u89e3.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "351",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n351. $y=2\\left(\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\sin2x+\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\cos2x\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "352",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n352*. $y=3\\cos\\left(3x+\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)+4\\sin\\left(3x+\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "353",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n353*. $y=\\frac{1}{2}(\\cos x-\\sin x)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "354",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n354. $y=3\\sin2x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "355",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n355. $y=4-8\\cos^2x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "356",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u8c10\u632f\u52a8\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n356*. $y=-2\\sin x-4\\sqrt{3}\\cos x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "357",
      "text": "\u5316\u7b80\uff1a\n357. $\\cos(\\pi-\\alpha)\\cdot\\operatorname{ctg}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\alpha\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "358",
      "text": "\u5316\u7b80\uff1a\n358. $\\frac{\\operatorname{ctg}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\alpha\\right)\\cdot\\sin\\left(\\beta-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)}{\\cos(\\pi-\\beta)\\cdot\\operatorname{tg}(-\\alpha)}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "359",
      "text": "\u5316\u7b80\uff1a\n359. $\\frac{1-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}+x\\right)}{1-\\sin^2(\\pi+x)}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "360",
      "text": "\u5316\u7b80\uff1a\n360. $\\frac{\\cos^2(\\pi-\\alpha)}{1-\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}-\\alpha\\right)}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "361",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n361. $\\operatorname{tg}x+\\operatorname{tg}(\\pi-x)+\\operatorname{ctg}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+x\\right)=\\operatorname{tg}(2\\pi-x)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "362",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n362. $\\sin(90^\\circ+y)\\cdot\\cos(180^\\circ-y)\\cdot\\operatorname{ctg}(270^\\circ+y)=\\sin(90^\\circ-y)\\cdot\\sin(270^\\circ-y)\\cdot\\operatorname{ctg}(90^\\circ+y)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "363",
      "text": "\u4e0d\u67e5\u8868\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n363. $10\\operatorname{ctg}135^\\circ\\cdot\\sin210^\\circ\\cdot\\cos225^\\circ$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "364",
      "text": "\u4e0d\u67e5\u8868\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n364. $2\\sin^2225^\\circ-\\operatorname{ctg}330^\\circ\\cdot\\operatorname{tg}405^\\circ$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "365",
      "text": "\u4e0d\u67e5\u8868\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n365. $\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\arcsin\\frac{1}{2}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "366",
      "text": "\u4e0d\u67e5\u8868\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n366. $\\arccos\\frac{1}{2}+\\arccos\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "367",
      "text": "\u4e0d\u67e5\u8868\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n367. $\\arcsin\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)+\\arccos\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "368",
      "text": "\u4e0d\u67e5\u8868\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n368. $\\operatorname{arctg}(-1)+\\operatorname{arctg}1$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "369",
      "text": "\u4e0d\u67e5\u8868\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\n369*. $\\operatorname{arctg}\\sqrt{3}+\\operatorname{arcctg}1$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "370",
      "text": "\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n370. $\\arccos0+\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\frac{3}{4}\\pi$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "371",
      "text": "\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n371. $\\arccos(-1)+\\arccos 1=\\pi$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "372",
      "text": "\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n372. $\\arcsin\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)=0$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "373",
      "text": "\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n373.* $\\operatorname{arctg}(-1)+\\operatorname{arcctg}1=0$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "374",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n374. $\\frac{\\cos 2\\alpha}{1+\\sin 2\\alpha}=\\frac{\\cos\\alpha-\\sin\\alpha}{\\cos\\alpha+\\sin\\alpha}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "375",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n375. $\\frac{\\operatorname{tg}^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\alpha\\right)-1}{\\operatorname{tg}^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\alpha\\right)+1}=\\sin 2\\alpha$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "376",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n376. $\\frac{1-\\cos 2\\alpha+\\sin 2\\alpha}{1+\\cos 2\\alpha+\\sin 2\\alpha}=\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "377",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n377. \u7b49\u5f0f $\\sin 15^\\circ\\cos 15^\\circ=\\frac{1}{4}$ \u6210\u7acb\u5417\uff1f",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "378",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n378. \u6c42 $\\sin\\frac{\\alpha}{2}$\u3001$\\cos\\frac{\\alpha}{2}$ \u548c $\\operatorname{tg}\\frac{\\alpha}{2}$\uff1a\na) \u8bbe $\\sin\\alpha=0.8$\uff0c$0<\\alpha<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\uff1b\nb) \u8bbe $\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha=3\\frac{3}{7}$\uff0c$180^\\circ<\\alpha<270^\\circ$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "379",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n379. $\\frac{\\cos\\frac{\\beta}{2}-\\sin\\frac{\\beta}{2}}{\\cos\\frac{\\beta}{2}+\\sin\\frac{\\beta}{2}}=\\frac{1}{\\cos\\beta}-\\operatorname{tg}\\beta$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "380",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n380. $\\operatorname{ctg}\\frac{\\alpha}{2}-\\operatorname{tg}\\frac{\\alpha}{2}=2\\operatorname{ctg}\\alpha$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "381",
      "text": "\u8bc1\u660e\u6052\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\n381. \u5df2\u77e5 $\\cos\\alpha=-\\frac{1}{2}$\uff0c$\\pi<\\alpha<\\frac{3\\pi}{2}$\uff0c\u7528 $\\operatorname{tg}\\frac{\\alpha}{2}$ \u8868\u793a $\\sin\\alpha$\uff0c$\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha$ \u548c $\\operatorname{ctg}\\alpha$ \u5e76\u6c42\u5b83\u4eec\u7684\u503c.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "382",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n382. $\\sin^4\\frac{x}{2}-\\cos^4\\frac{x}{2}=0.25$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "383",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n383. $\\cos^2 x+4\\sin^2 x=2\\sin 2x$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "384",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n384. $4(1+\\cos x)=3\\sin^2\\frac{x}{2}\\cos\\frac{x}{2}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "385",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n385. $\\sin x+\\sin 3x=0$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "386",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n386. $\\cos 2x-\\cos 6x=0$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "387",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n387. $\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}+x\\right)-\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}-x\\right)=1$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "388",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u548c\u7684\u5f62\u5f0f\uff1a\n388.* $\\sin(2x+y)\\cos(x+2y)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "389",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u548c\u7684\u5f62\u5f0f\uff1a\n389.* $\\cos(2\\alpha-\\beta)\\cos(2\\alpha+\\beta)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "390",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u548c\u7684\u5f62\u5f0f\uff1a\n390.* $\\sin(2x-y)\\sin(x+2y)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "391",
      "text": "\u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u548c\u7684\u5f62\u5f0f\uff1a\n391.* $4\\cos^2\\frac{x}{2}\\cdot\\sin^2\\frac{x}{2}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    }
  ],
